1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
If you have ever stood amidst the weight of history...

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
You would know that monumental greatness and catastrophic collapse...

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,500
Often originate from the very same source...

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:19,500
And that is... 'unbridled ambition.'

5
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,500
In the summer of 2014, the entire gaming industry held its breath.

6
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Ubisoft announced a technological marvel set during the French Revolution.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Paris 1789. Reconstructed not as an impression, but at a true 1:1 metric scale.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Ten studios across the globe. Thousands of developers. An unprecedented budget.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
This was meant to be the benchmark of eighth-generation gaming.

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,500
The flagship showcase of the PlayStation 4 and Xbox One.

11
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:56,000
Yet, on November 11, 2014... players stepped into a very different reality.

12
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000
A Paris that was astonishingly detailed...

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Yet crumbling beneath the weight of its own code.

14
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:12,500
Floating eyeballs. Missing faces. Hollow skull sockets hovering in the dark.

15
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:17,500
It became the defining meme of a gaming generation.

16
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:23,500
Within days, Ubisoft's market capitalization lost over 9% in value.

17
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:29,000
The stock plummeted. The global press mocked them relentlessly.

18
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:34,500
And a decade-long annual release model faced its sudden demise.

19
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:40,000
How did one of the most ambitious technological projects in video game history...

20
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:45,500
Turn into the most infamous launch disaster of the modern era?

21
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:51,000
This is the investigation into Assassin's Creed: Unity.

